  "2026-10-10T19:37:23.079Z","harness:codex","Final verification includes 27 benchmark tests plus the unchanged-base runtime comparison. Node26 observations include an unqualified control refusal during load and a separate qualified merge-entrypoint overrun (241 ms against226 ms), which is retained rather than treated as a pass. The SDK measurement recovery no longer imports Commander registration after pure argv extraction; focused144-test verification and typechecking pass. The historical diagnosis remains owned by pm-bj7rq0."
  "2026-10-10T19:50:51.653Z","harness:codex","Reviewed delivery: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1436 includes both bracketed startup gates, complete fail-closed reports, portable methodology, 27 linked tests and this bounded closure. Initial source commit a279913ba retains all budgets; real Node24 gates pass. Historical cause diagnosis remains open under the parent. Final-head CI and review are required before merge; the latest published changelog generator checked the Unreleased entry."
